: https://www.oculus.com/experiences/quest/5556605911096889/\n\nHello! Welcome to TUBE Industries: a hamster owned and operated tube puzzle emporium! \n\nPrepare for a tube-based, puzzle-filled, HAM-PACKED adventure with our charismatic leader: The BOSS. Here at TUBE Industries we provide the puzzles and you provide\u2026 the brains. No shady business here!\n\nThis is only a demo, but the full game contains the following TUBE-Based Benefits:\n\u2022 60 levels across 3 themed floors: Hamster Hangout, Smart Home Slide & Bakery Blitz!\n\u2022 Customize your hamster\u2019s appearance!\n\u2022 Classic and slide-based tube puzzles!\n\u2022 Numerous Mini-Puzzles including our new hamster cannon!\n\u2022 Chat with the BOSS and help him deal with important \u201cbusiness decisions\u201d!\n\u2022 Relaxed-pace gameplay with no time pressure.\n\u2022 Supports seated, standing, or room scale play.\n\nYour destination for Tube-Based entertainment awaits!\n\nSincerely,\nThe BOSS", "short_description": "\u2b50 Play 136 hamster-approved puzzles across 60 levels in the full game! \u2b50\n\nGet the full game: https://www.oculus.com/experiences/quest/5556605911096889/\n\nHello! Welcome to TUBE Industries: a hamster owned and operated tube puzzle emporium! \n\nPrepare for a tube-based, puzzle-filled, HAM-PACKED adventure with our charismatic leader: The BOSS. Here at TUBE Industries we provide the puzzles and you provide\u2026 the brains. No shady business here!\n\nSincerely,\nThe BOSS"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bluemonttechnology.com/game%20privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bluemont Technology & Research, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tubebecontinued.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": nu